00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:12.130
But the guards stopped us!

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:15.100
They stopped us and they said
we couldn't give her the card

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.870
because we didn't have VIP tickets.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.930
And I was very discouraged,
but my mom said

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:22.770
you can keep the card
and maybe one day you'll

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:24.560
you meet her and you'll give it to her.

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:26.860
So the card is very special to me.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:28.340
- Well out of those 2 billion views,

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:29.570
she's gotta be one of 'em, right?

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:31.760
Like I'm like if, if
y'all do some more things,

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:34.000
but we do have someone here
cuz we heard about your card.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.730
So we have someone here
that does know Lindsay

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:36.750
