00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.280
So you might be familiar with her,

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:41.740
she also plays violin and
she's a YouTube sensation.

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:43.660
She also has five hit albums.

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:45.923
She is what we call a whole lotta woman.

00:07:45.923 --> 00:07:48.423
(funky music)

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.840
I love your face right
now. You're like, what?

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:55.453
I'm just gonna say it:
it's Lindsey Stirling!

00:07:55.453 --> 00:07:56.286
Get out here!

00:07:56.286 --> 00:07:58.869
(upbeat music)

00:08:00.498 --> 00:08:04.340
