00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:06.930
- [Karolina] I, I can't believe it's you!

00:08:09.105 --> 00:08:10.865
- [Kelly] Have a seat, have a seat!

00:08:10.865 --> 00:08:11.998
- Yeah, have a seat!

00:08:11.998 --> 00:08:13.983
- First of all? I love

00:08:13.983 --> 00:08:16.285
