00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:22.125
Oh my God, there's a
movie in here somewhere.

00:08:22.125 --> 00:08:24.030
Okay. So wait, so meet Karolina.

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:26.070
You said that you've seen some
of her videos though, right?

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:28.350
- I have seen so many of your videos

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:29.760
and I have to say my favorite thing

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:32.210
about watching your videos is you sparkle.

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:34.460
You literally, even just
sitting here, you sparkle

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:35.570
your personality shines through

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:37.320
so much through your performances.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.153
- Thank you

00:08:38.153 --> 00:08:40.020
And so I was like this
girl's got something special.

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:41.405
And I wish I could say that-

00:08:41.405 --> 00:08:42.349
(Audience applauds)

00:08:42.349 --> 00:08:45.680
Right? I wish I could
say that you remind me

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:49.255
