you're so much more talented.

00:08:49.255 --> 00:08:50.371
(laughter)

00:08:50.371 --> 00:08:51.357
- Well she's just doing it younger.

00:08:51.357 --> 00:08:53.760
- Yeah, yeah. I was not dancing

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.070
when I was playing when I was your age.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:57.096
And so anyways, it's
just so nice to meet you.

00:08:57.096 --> 00:08:59.455
- Oh me too. It's so nice to meet you.

00:08:59.455 --> 00:09:01.630
I can't believe it.

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:04.460
- This, this beats, the
Christmas concert, right?

